i Tanba"},{"id":555562,"name":"Yukio Horikita","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nMN21nawwsRi1ziigOpqVikLpJj.jpg"},{"id":1088160,"name":"Tokio Oki"},{"id":1008468,"name":"Tadashi Iwata"},{"id":125017,"name":"Yūsaku Terashima","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dhuJtitCvsBLf5ycAbTf6F2DqmX.jpg"},{"id":555558,"name":"Manabu Morita","role":"Omi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/deac1rB55fzzzArShmr3frcUM0t.jpg"},{"id":555583,"name":"Yūji Hamada","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jlhppX7PG2MpE6EbR77eYhapUx8.jpg"},{"id":555565,"name":"Hajime Koshikawa"},{"id":134621,"name":"Jun Fujikawa","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5Wv81uX29uuFhmbG7NCiXsCTWcJ.jpg"},{"id":1423049,"name":"Goro Kumon"},{"id":1485570,"name":"Shōji Mori"},{"id":1092509,"name":"Sumao Ishihara"},{"id":1863317,"name":"Kôji Uehara"},{"id":1863318,"name":"Tamotsu Fujiharu"},{"id":1863319,"name":"Jun Soloni"},{"id":134619,"name":"Kanae Kobayashi","role":"Bereaved Woman's Servant","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tLyqCS0ap8Q6EVFlHN0hqA5TyBn.jpg"},{"id":1863320,"name":"Shinji Nunome"},{"id":1863321,"name":"Iwao Kasumi"},{"id":1909920,"name":"Kazuo Mortuchi"},{"id":1863323,"name":"Kazuo Ōbayashi"},{"id":1863324,"name":"Yoshumitsu Shimonura"},{"id":1863325,"name":"Kazuyo Yanaka"},{"id":1863326,"name":"Masami Kojomon"},{"id":2629351,"name":"Chizu Kobayashi"},{"id":80713,"name":"Yutaka Nakamura","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zYAR0JexnpguIAN2t2gilPfwnxB.jpg"},{"id":119185,"name":"Akiji Kobayashi","role":"Narrator","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yW9v9sIDGmox7RfF7wFqqrlIKDU.jpg"},{"id":128023,"name":"Yūnosuke Itō","role":"Retsudô Yagyû","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qKOpTphhFi9IQKSx0Dk7LwfSx0h.jpg"},{"id":4894835,"name":"Jinichiro Ando"},{"id":1311176,"name":"Yoshiko Fujita","role":"Azami Ogami","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mZMJBY86KrtOvduTvbbrTGcQxlV.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Lone Wolf and Cub: Sword of Vengeance","overview":"L'inizio della saga: durante il viaggio verso le terme Komori, dove deve svolgere una delicata missione, Ogami ricorda gli eventi precedenti della sua vita che lo hanno portato a perdere tutto e diventare il lupo solitario. Da segnalare gli epici duelli contro Bizen e Kurando Jagyu."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Lone Wolf and Cub: Sword of Vengeance","overview":"Official Shogunate executioner Ogami Itto has been framed for disloyalty to the Shogunate by the Yagyu clan, against whom he now is waging a one-man war, along with his infant son, Daigoro."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"小池一雄・小島剛夕のコンビによる『漫画アクション』に連載の人気劇画を勝プロダクション製作、若山富三郎主演で映画化した娯楽時代劇シリーズの第1作。若山富三郎が小池一夫の家に自ら押しかけて直談判しその映画化権を得た。脚本も小池一雄が執筆。\r 江戸時代、徳川幕府によって切腹を命じられた大名の介錯を務める、公儀介錯人の拝一刀。ところが、彼に代わってその重大な役職をせしめようと、柳生烈堂率いる柳生一族が、幕府の逆賊の汚名を着せて一刀を追い落としにかかり、愛妻を殺された彼は、まだ幼い一子・大五郎を連れて流浪の旅に出るはめとなる。とある藩でひそかに進行する世継ぎ暗殺の策謀を阻止するよう依頼を受けた一刀は、悪党どもが巣くう湯治場へいざ乗り込む。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vQDI0iM0zulplBMTNlj80j2u5Zn.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r6kZzTqPxaiqpLTJdDJzgItz5bf.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":41471,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uxJJIzw3lDM0RbFQMQsTTRyFO2D.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uxJJIzw3lDM0RbFQMQsTTRyFO2D.jpg","language":"en","width":1450,"height":2175},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uxJJIzw3lDM0RbFQMQsTTRyFO2D.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uxJJIzw3lDM0RbFQMQsTTRyFO2D.jpg","language":"en","width":1450,"height":2175},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/